---
import { SITE, whatsappUrl, whatsappDisplay } from "../config";
---

<section id="contacto" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pt-8 pb-24 md:pb-28">
  <div
    class="reveal flex flex-col items-center gap-6 rounded-lg border border-amber/35 bg-amber/5 px-6 py-14 text-center md:px-12 md:py-16"
  >
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.16em] text-amber">
      [ 05 / CANAL DIRECTO ]
    </p>
    <h2
      class="display max-w-2xl text-[clamp(32px,4.5vw,52px)] leading-[1.1] [font-stretch:125%]"
    >
      ¿Su operación necesita un sistema que sí funcione?
    </h2>
    <p class="max-w-lg text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-fog">
      Cuénteme qué proceso quiere automatizar o medir. Respondo en menos de 24
      horas, sin intermediarios.
    </p>
    <a
      href={whatsappUrl()}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded bg-amber px-9 py-4.5 font-mono text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-[0.06em] text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-paper"
    >
      ▸ ESCRIBIR POR WHATSAPP
    </a>
    <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.08em] text-fog">
      {whatsappDisplay()} · REMOTO ·{" "}
      <a
        href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}
        class="text-teal transition-colors hover:text-amber">{SITE.email}</a
      >
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer
  class="border-t border-paper/10 px-5 py-6"
>
  <div
    class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-fog sm:flex-row"
  >
    <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} {SITE.marca}</p>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
      <a
        href={SITE.github}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="transition-colors hover:text-teal">GITHUB</a
      >
      {
        SITE.linkedin && (
          <a
            href={SITE.linkedin}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="transition-colors hover:text-teal"
          >
            LINKEDIN
          </a>
        )
      }
      <span>PYTHON · FASTAPI · REACT · IOT · IA</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
